过渡，呈现流动的波浪视觉效果；下层为白色水平条纹压型铝板幕墙，嵌入深色玻璃长条窗与玻璃门，保持原设计开窗位置与比例；右侧连接低矮裙房，覆盖银灰色横向金属百叶；建筑置于晴朗蓝天之下，前景为沥青道路与修剪整齐的草坪，自然光照明，建筑摄影，超高清细节，8K分辨率，专业建筑表现图风格\n```\n\n---\n\n## 英文提示词（备用）\n\n```\nModern industrial building exterior, building number A4, two-story volume composition: upper floor with curved glass curtain wall, gradient teal-green LOW-E glass with white aluminum horizontal framing, color transitioning from deep emerald at bottom to light mint at top, wave-like visual effect; lower floor with white horizontal ribbed aluminum panel cladding, dark tinted glass strip windows and glass doors in original positions; attached low-rise annex with silver-gray horizontal metal louvers; clear blue sky, asphalt road, manicured lawn in foreground, natural daylight, architectural photography, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, 8K, professional architectural visualization\n```\n\n---\n\n## 关键控制要点\n\n| 要素 | 说明 |\n|:---|:---|\n| **开窗关系** | 严格保持图1的网格位置、长条窗比例、门洞位置 |\n| **材质映射** | 图2的青绿渐变玻璃→图1上层曲面；白色条纹铝板→图1下层 |\n| **视角** | 保持两点透视，建筑转角为视觉中心 |\n| **环境** | 添加实景要素（道路、草坪、天空）增强真实感 |\n\n如需调整材质色调（更蓝绿/更青绿）或环境氛围（黄昏/阴天），可进一步细化。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 314, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 170, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e900c2ca9c0d90b0896881910ca7f3f02d88ebd8", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [1248.56982421875, 884.8882446289062], "pos": [1716.636474609375, -420.70556640625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 323,